# Root-level ignores for the monorepo.
# Each service also has its own .gitignore for build output (target/, etc.).

### Secrets & local overrides (never commit) ###
*.env
.env
application-local.yml
application-local.properties
*.pem
*.key

### OS files ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### IDEs ###
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

### Logs ###
*.log
logs/
